title: EchoState
act: Mine
location: Deep
quest: echo
color: blue
---
// The echo of the deep level is a project of its own, loaded with the game and played by a runner of its own in the
// deep level's scene. It shares the game's variables with the story: the story declares $echo_answered too, and reads
// what the echo set; $echo_riddles is the echo's alone.
/// The echo was answered.
<<declare $echo_answered = false>>
/// How many riddles the echo asked.
<<declare $echo_riddles = 0>>
===

title: Echo
act: Mine
location: Deep
quest: echo
when: not $echo_answered
---
<<set $echo_riddles to $echo_riddles + 1>>
<<if $echo_riddles == 1>>
    Echo: Who calls? Who calls? Who calls?
    Echo: Answer, and I will be quiet. Fail, and I will say your name all night.
<<else>>
    Echo: Back again. The [ordinal value={$echo_riddles} one="%st" two="%nd" few="%rd" other="%th" /] riddle, then.
<<endif>>
<<jump EchoRiddle>>
===

title: EchoRiddle
act: Mine
location: Deep
quest: echo
---
// Each visit throws a die for the riddle.
<<declare $echo_roll = 0>>
<<set $echo_roll to dice(3)>>
<<if $echo_roll == 1>>
    Echo: I have a bed but never sleep, a mouth but never eat. What am I?
    -> A river.
        <<jump EchoRight>>
    -> A mine.
        <<jump EchoWrong>>
    -> A lantern.
        <<jump EchoWrong>>
<<elseif $echo_roll == 2>>
    Echo: The more you take, the more you leave behind. What are they?
    -> Footsteps.
        <<jump EchoRight>>
    -> Coins.
        <<jump EchoWrong>>
    -> Years.
        <<jump EchoWrong>>
<<else>>
    Echo: I speak without a tongue and hear without ears. What am I?
    -> A bell.
        <<jump EchoWrong>>
    -> An echo.
        <<jump EchoRight>>
    -> A ghost.
        <<jump EchoWrong>>
<<endif>>
===

title: EchoRight
act: Mine
location: Deep
quest: echo
---
Echo: Right. Right. Right...
The voice fades into the stone, and the deep level is quiet.
<<set $echo_answered to true>>
===

title: EchoWrong
act: Mine
location: Deep
quest: echo
---
Echo: Wrong. Wrong. Wrong...
The echo laughs, far away. It will ask again.
===

title: Echo
act: Mine
location: Deep
quest: echo
when: $echo_answered
---
=> The hole in the rock is quiet.
=> Something drips, far down. The echo says nothing.
===
